{
  "id": "1056",
  "title": "The Cow Ate the Grass",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-10-03",
  "synopsis": "Today, Little Ming is in art class.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1056/49ec6ea4efa955fb7ddba619102cdc544c51b40f.mp3?1595245198",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "牛吃草\n\n    一天，美术老师要同学们画画。不一会儿，小明给了老师一张白纸。\n    老师问：“你画的是什么？”\n    小明说：“牛吃草。”\n    老师问：“草呢？”\n    小明说：“牛吃完了。”\n    老师又问：“那牛呢？”\n    小明说：“牛吃完草，已经走了！”",
    "traditional": "牛吃草\n\n    一天，美術老師要同學們畫畫。不一會兒，小明給了老師一張白紙。\n    老師問：“你畫的是什麼？”\n    小明說：“牛吃草。”\n    老師問：“草呢？”\n    小明說：“牛吃完了。”\n    老師又問：“那牛呢？”\n    小明說：“牛吃完草，已經走了！”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Cow Ate the Grass"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，美术老师要同学们画画。",
      "traditional": "一天，美術老師要同學們畫畫。",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān měi shù lǎo shī yào tóng xué men huà huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "不一会儿，小明给了老师一张白纸。",
      "traditional": "不一會兒，小明給了老師一張白紙。",
      "pinyin": "bù yí huì'r xiǎo míng gěi le lǎo shī yì zhāng bái zhǐ",
      "english": "One day, the art teacher asked the students to draw a picture."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Not long after, Little Ming gave the teacher a blank sheet of paper."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "老师问：“你画的是什么？”",
      "traditional": "老師問：“你畫的是什麼？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī wèn nǐ huà de shì shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The teacher asked, “What did you draw?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小明说：“牛吃草。”",
      "traditional": "小明說：“牛吃草。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng shuō niú chī cǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming said, “A cow eating grass.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "老师问：“草呢？”",
      "traditional": "老師問：“草呢？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī wèn cǎo ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The teacher asked, “What about the grass?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小明说：“牛吃完了。”",
      "traditional": "小明說：“牛吃完了。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng shuō niú chī wán le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming said, “The cow ate it all.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "老师又问：“那牛呢？”",
      "traditional": "老師又問：“那牛呢？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī yòu wèn nà niú ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The teacher asked again, “Then what about the cow?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小明说：“牛吃完草，已经走了！”",
      "traditional": "小明說：“牛吃完草，已經走了！”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng shuō niú chī wán cǎo yǐ jīng zǒu le",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
