      "The Cow Ate the Grass",
      "",
      "One day, the art teacher asked the students to draw a picture.",
      "Not long after, Little Ming gave the teacher a blank sheet of paper.",
      "",
      "The teacher asked, “What did you draw?”",
      "",
      "Little Ming said, “A cow eating grass.”",
      "",
      "The teacher asked, “What about the grass?”",
      "",
      "Little Ming said, “The cow ate it all.”",
      "",
      "The teacher asked again, “Then what about the cow?”",
      "",
      "Little Ming said, “The cow finished eating the grass, and has already left!”"
